# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public (client-safe) — exposed to the browser via Vite.
# Safe to commit placeholders; real values are injected by Lovable Cloud.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="<your-publishable-anon-key>"
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID="<your-project-ref>"

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server-only mirrors — available to server functions / routes
# via process.env.*. Never prefix these with VITE_ and never
# import them into client code.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SUPABASE_URL="https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co"
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="<your-publishable-anon-key>"

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS — MUST stay server-side. Do NOT add a VITE_ version.
# Do NOT commit real values. On Lovable Cloud these are managed
# via the Secrets tool (Project Settings → Secrets), not .env.
#   - SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY  bypasses RLS; admin-only code paths
#   - SUPABASE_DB_URL            direct Postgres connection string
#   - LOVABLE_API_KEY            Lovable AI Gateway + connectors
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY="<server-only — never expose>"
# SUPABASE_DB_URL="<server-only — never expose>"
# LOVABLE_API_KEY="<auto-provisioned — never expose>"